#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:266
msgid ""
"Ceph and Corosync ports are only required for multi-node clusters using "
"converged (HCI) storage. Single-host deployments or clusters using "
"external storage do not require these ports."
msgstr "Los puertos de Ceph y Corosync solo son necesarios para clústeres multinodo que utilizan almacenamiento convergente (HCI). Las implementaciones de un solo host o clústeres que utilizan almacenamiento externo no requieren estos puertos."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:269
msgid "Preparing Multiple Hosts"
msgstr "Preparación de múltiples hosts"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:271
msgid "If you plan to deploy an HVM cluster:"
msgstr "Si planea implementar un clúster HVM:"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:273
msgid ""
"Repeat the HVM OS installation and configuration on **each host** that "
"will be part of the cluster"
msgstr "Repita la instalación y configuración de HVM OS en **cada host** que formará parte del clúster"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:274
msgid ""
"Ensure all hosts can communicate with each other over the ports listed "
"above"
msgstr "Asegúrese de que todos los hosts puedan comunicarse entre sí a través de los puertos listados arriba"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:275
msgid ""
"Use consistent network interface naming across hosts where possible "
"(e.g., ``eth0`` for management, ``eth1`` for storage, ``eth2`` for "
"compute)"
msgstr "Use nomenclatura de interfaz de red consistente entre hosts cuando sea posible (por ejemplo, ``eth0`` para administración, ``eth1`` para almacenamiento, ``eth2`` para compute)"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:276
msgid ""
"Deploy the Morpheus Manager VM onto **one** host using the HPE Morpheus "
"Manager Installer"
msgstr "Implemente la VM Morpheus Manager en **un** host usando el HPE Morpheus Manager Installer"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep.rst:277
msgid ""
"After the Morpheus appliance is running, add the remaining hosts to the "
"cluster from within the |morpheus| UI (Infrastructure > Clusters > + ADD "
"CLUSTER)"
msgstr "Después de que el dispositivo Morpheus esté en ejecución, agregue los hosts restantes al clúster desde la UI de |morpheus| (Infrastructure > Clusters > + ADD CLUSTER)"

